  "known_limitations": [
    "The lzbench benchmark table itself exercises the raw LZ4 block API; this adapter uses the complete LZ4 frame implementation vendored by the same benchmark.",
    "The project wrapper exposes persistent LZ4F_compressUpdate/compressEnd and incremental LZ4F_decompress contexts for the separately keyed streaming profile; query and random access remain unregistered.",
    "The Python FFI descriptor serialization and contiguous byte materialization are included in the declared adapter boundary.",
    "LeakSanitizer cannot run under the host container ptrace policy; ASan/UBSan qualification ran with detect_leaks=0.",
    "2026-10-11: new isolated builds pin actual per-TU compiler dependencies, objects, selected toolchain executables and linked dynamic runtime files. These records do not pin every implicit static startup/runtime archive and do not grant source FULL_PARITY or change active algorithm scope. Historical runs retain their original artifact identities."
  ],
